          "path": "_m/u/1/0/z/harwich-wp/1953-floods-harwich-6016899521.jpg",
          "filename": "1953 Floods Harwich (6016899521).jpg",
          "caption": "I remember walking to school one morning in a 'crocodile' with the girls from the convent in Dovercourt.\nWe were stopped at the Police Station and told we could go no further.\nI could see the water lapping not far from the the police Staition. \nWhen the water receeded we walked into Harwich to see the damage,\nthere was a boat in the school playground.  \n \n\nMemories by : Ruth Wright.",
